      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents note that dogs and cats remain remarkably calm during examinations and vaccinations. The clinical staff uses affectionate handling techniques that reduce nervousness in anxious animals. Multiple clients mention that pets who usually fear the vet show genuine comfort with the doctors and technicians here."
      }
    },
