        "en": "Clients describe successful treatments for complex medical issues including seizure management, respiratory infections, and unexpected tumors. Reviewers emphasize clear recovery instructions and honest diagnostic evaluations. Pet owners feel confident in the team's ability to stabilize urgent health crises."
      }
